| AWS Textract | Natural language ⚠️ | Partial ⚠️ | Labels only ❌ |
| olmOCR | `\int_{0}^{k} e^{5x} dx = 9` ✓ | Preserved ✓ | N/A |
| Qwen3-VL | `\int_{0}^{k} e^{5x} dx = 9` ✓ | Preserved ✓ | Geometric relations ✓ |

